OL,3,GNEWSAMurder accused 'didn't mean to    
OL,4,Apush man in marina'                    
OL,6,FRandle told the court when he went on  
OL,7,Fnights out, he often mixed alcohol and 
OL,8,Fdrugs. He said cocaine could make him  
OL,9,F"hyper" and he also took ketamine to   
OL,10,Fmake him "cool and calm". He added the 
OL,11,Faltercation "all happened so fast".    
